architecture-audit/cycle-005-process-tree-dependency-ownership/reviews/round-01-review.md:102:4. **Both proposals should tighten validation language around the dependency compatibility-shim deletion**, naming the focused tests that will prove deletion-cascade and dependency registration behavior still works without `rebuildDependencyMaps()`.
